140	10	Can I rush my order?	We treat every order as a rush order and do our best to ship parts as quickly as possible! For this reason we aren’t able to offer expedited production for all orders and operations.	6	2026-03-25 18:40:59.793468	2026-03-25 18:40:59.793468
141	10	Can I overnight my order?	If your order qualifies, you will see the option to add Overnight Shipping to your order at checkout. This option will not be available for parts shipped outside the US. The express shipping fee will depend on the size and weight of your order.	7	2026-03-25 18:40:59.7938	2026-03-25 18:40:59.7938
142	10	What could potentially slow down my order?	Your order could be slowed down if there are special requests, if your files do not meet our design guidelines and require revision, or if your order includes post processing services that add lead time.	8	2026-03-25 18:40:59.79402	2026-03-25 18:40:59.79402
143	10	I need my parts NOW! How quickly can I get them?	We’re unable to speed up production of parts that are already being processed. However, overnight shipping is available for qualifying orders that will be delivered within the US.	9	2026-03-25 18:40:59.7943	2026-03-25 18:40:59.7943
144	10	How quickly will I receive my parts?	How quickly you receive your parts will depend on the services added to your order and overall part volume. The estimated ship date for your order is calculated in real-time in your shopping cart as you add parts and services. Then, the estimated ship date is confirmed when you check out.	10	2026-03-25 18:40:59.794587	2026-03-25 18:40:59.794587
145	10	When will my order ship?	Your estimated ship date is calculated in real-time in your shopping cart as you add parts and services. Then, your estimated ship date is confirmed when you check out. You can also find the estimated ship date and follow your order’s production status through the tracking link we’ll email you.	11	2026-03-25 18:40:59.794828	2026-03-25 18:40:59.794828
146	11	Why can’t I add finishing to my part?	You won’t be able to add anodizing, plating, or powder coating to your part before checkout if your design doesn’t meet our requirements. Parts must have a hole at least .063″ wide for hanging, fall within our overall part size limits, and be made from a material that supports the desired service.	1	2026-03-25 18:40:59.79508	2026-03-25 18:40:59.79508
147	11	Can you provide Ra or surface roughness specifications for your materials?	We don’t provide Ra or surface roughness specs for our materials because finishes can vary by supplier and batch. If no finishing service is added, your parts will ship with the standard mill finish, which may include light scratches.	2	2026-03-25 18:40:59.795556	2026-03-25 18:40:59.795556
148	11	Can I request a specific grain direction for my sheet metal parts?	No — we can’t guarantee a specific grain direction. Parts are cut for maximum material efficiency, so grain direction can vary. If grain direction matters, apply your desired finish after you receive your parts.	3	2026-03-25 18:40:59.796265	2026-03-25 18:40:59.796265
149	11	Do you offer plating services?	We do offer plating services for sheet metal parts! Take a look at our Plating Guidelines to learn about the part and material requirements for our plating services. Once your design is ready, upload your file to our website, select an eligible material, and add electroplating to your parts before checkout!	4	2026-03-25 18:40:59.796896	2026-03-25 18:40:59.796896
150	11	Will my deburred parts have sharp edges?	Parts with our linear deburring service will have sharp edges. The surface will be smooth and “cleaned up” from laser cutting, but there will be no edge softening.	5	2026-03-25 18:40:59.797154	2026-03-25 18:40:59.797154
151	11	What metal colors do you offer?	At DMS Engineering we stock over 15 different sheet metal types in a wide range of natural unfinished hues. Additionally, we offer anodizing, plating, and powder coating services that can provide red, yellow, gold, green, blue, white, and black surface finishes.	6	2026-03-25 18:40:59.797392	2026-03-25 18:40:59.797392
152	11	Which materials are available for anodizing?	At this time we anodize 5052, 6061, and 7075 aluminum. Many non-ferrous metal materials can be anodized, but aluminum is the best candidate and creates the most successful finish.	7	2026-03-25 18:40:59.797593	2026-03-25 18:40:59.797593
153	11	Is your powder coating fingerprint resistant?	Our wrinkle black powder coating is fingerprint resistant. All other colors will show fingerprints. These are easily removed by using a soft cloth with mild soap and water.	8	2026-03-25 18:40:59.797864	2026-03-25 18:40:59.797864
154	11	Will other services be performed before or after finishing?	Bending, countersinking, and tapping services are performed before finishing services. Hardware is installed after anodizing and plating, but before powder coating. Parts with both hardware and powder coating services will have the hardware capped/plugged before being powder coated.	9	2026-03-25 18:40:59.798215	2026-03-25 18:40:59.798215
155	11	Can you apply finishing services to specific areas of my part?	If you choose to add a finishing service (anodizing, plating, or powder coating) to parts, we will apply the finish to the entire part. We’re unable to provide masking or finish specific areas or portions of parts, and not other areas.	10	2026-03-25 18:40:59.7986	2026-03-25 18:40:59.7986
156	11	Will nickel plating hold up to polishing or sanding?	Our nickel plating is quite thin (adding approximately ~0.0002″ per side), so you will need to be careful to avoid wearing through the finish. A small amount of light polishing may be doable but any more aggressive treatment like sanding could penetrate through to the underlying material.	11	2026-03-25 18:40:59.798863	2026-03-25 18:40:59.798863
157	11	How to prep metal parts for painting or welding?	If you plan to paint or weld your metal parts after you receive them, you can use acetone to clean them up beforehand and remove all oils.	12	2026-03-25 18:40:59.799183	2026-03-25 18:40:59.799183
158	11	What are the thicknesses for your finishes?	Our finishing services can add ~0.0004”-0.01″ to the overall thickness of your parts depending on the finish type (anodizing, plating, or powder coating). See the FAQ or service guidelines for details.	13	2026-03-25 18:40:59.799577	2026-03-25 18:40:59.799577
159	11	What is the smallest/largest part I can have deburred?	Linear deburring is available for parts as small as 1″ x 3″ and as large as 24″ x 46″ depending on the design, material, and geometry.	14	2026-03-25 18:40:59.799793	2026-03-25 18:40:59.799793
160	11	Why can’t I select deburring for my part?	If deburring is not an option before checkout, it’s typically because the material and/or stock thickness is not eligible or the overall flat part size is too small or too large. Please see our deburring page to confirm requirements for the service.	15	2026-03-25 18:40:59.799987	2026-03-25 18:40:59.799987
161	11	Do you offer deburring?	We offer linear deburring for eligible laser cut parts. If your part qualifies for linear deburring, it will be automatically selected at checkout. You can deselect it if you prefer to not have your part deburred.	16	2026-03-25 18:40:59.800207	2026-03-25 18:40:59.800207
162	12	How to change the shipping address for my account?	You can update the shipping addresses for your account under account Settings. It’s also possible to update your shipping address at the Billing & Shipping step of checkout.	1	2026-03-25 18:40:59.800402	2026-03-25 18:40:59.800402
163	12	Do you offer white label packaging or drop shipping?	We do not offer white label packaging or drop shipping at this time. Currently all parts ship in DMS Engineering branded packaging.	2	2026-03-25 18:40:59.800617	2026-03-25 18:40:59.800617
164	12	Can you pass delivery instructions to shipping carriers?	We’re unable to pass delivery instructions along to shipping carriers for you. Instead we recommend contacting the carrier after your package has shipped to submit any special instructions directly.	3	2026-03-25 18:40:59.800874	2026-03-25 18:40:59.800874
165	12	What is my DMS Engineering order status?	You can check the status of any order by logging into your DMS Engineering account, navigating to the Orders page, and clicking the Track Order link on the order.	4	2026-03-25 18:40:59.801128	2026-03-25 18:40:59.801128
166	12	Can you cut material I ship to you?	Due to safety and procedural risks, DMS Engineering does not cut or process raw material that is shipped to us from customers. Additionally, we cannot accept raw material or components from vendors such as McMaster-Carr per request for specific customers or projects.	5	2026-03-25 18:40:59.801519	2026-03-25 18:40:59.801519
167	12	Can you ship to my PO Box, APO, or FPO address?	We do not ship to PO boxes, APO, or FPO addresses at this time. Please provide us with a physical address. Read our shipping information page and policies for more information about our shipping process, if your order qualifies for free shipping, and factors that may affect your order processing times.	6	2026-03-25 18:40:59.801797	2026-03-25 18:40:59.801797
168	12	How can I track my package?	Package tracking is automatic with DMS Engineering! Once your order has been placed and processed, you will receive tracking information via email or mobile device when a tracking number has been created.	7	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802007	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802007
169	12	How can I get help with my order?	Our Customer Support and Applications Engineering teams are available on weekdays to assist you with any questions or concerns. Reach out and we’ll get back to you within 4 business hours.	8	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802195	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802195
170	12	What are DMS Engineering’s shipping pickup times, deadlines, and guidelines on address changes?	Our carriers pick up orders multiple times a day on weekdays. Although we package parts and create labels 7 days a week, shipments aren’t picked up on Sundays or after 4pm local time Mondays-Saturdays. Once a label is created, we cannot make address changes or convert the order to local pickup.	9	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802397	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802397
171	12	Can I rush my order?	We treat every order as a rush order and do our best to ship parts as quickly as possible! For this reason we aren’t able to offer expedited production for all orders and operations.	10	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802664	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802664
195	14	What are your tolerances for bending?	You can find tolerances for bending in the specifications on each material info page in our Material Catalog. Learn about tolerance stackup considerations in the full FAQ!	7	2026-03-25 18:40:59.807928	2026-03-25 18:40:59.807928
172	12	Can I overnight my order?	If your order qualifies, you will see the option to add Overnight Shipping to your order at checkout. This option will not be available for parts shipped outside the US. The express shipping fee will depend on the size and weight of your order.	11	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802855	2026-03-25 18:40:59.802855
173	12	I need my parts NOW! How quickly can I get them?	We’re unable to speed up production of parts that are already being processed. However, overnight shipping is available for qualifying orders that will be delivered within the US.	12	2026-03-25 18:40:59.803069	2026-03-25 18:40:59.803069
174	12	Can you use my shipping account or preferred carrier?	We cannot use 3rd party accounts or carriers due to our highly automated shipping system. With that in mind, you can trust we will ship your parts as quickly and efficiently as possible.	13	2026-03-25 18:40:59.803251	2026-03-25 18:40:59.803251
175	12	How quickly will I receive my parts?	How quickly you receive your parts will depend on the services added to your order and overall part volume. The estimated ship date for your order is calculated in real-time in your shopping cart as you add parts and services. Then, the estimated ship date is confirmed when you check out.	14	2026-03-25 18:40:59.80343	2026-03-25 18:40:59.80343
176	12	Do you offer local pickup?	Local pickup is available to qualifying orders that exceed 20 lbs. Contact our Support team to confirm if your parts are eligible for pickup at the DMS Engineering manufacturing facility closest to you.	15	2026-03-25 18:40:59.80363	2026-03-25 18:40:59.80363
