um is a good middle of the road alloy, pairing the strength of 7075 with the malleability of 5052.", "items": ["Construction", "Stressed components", "Electronics enclosures", "Automotive", "Aerospace structural", "Bicycle frames", "Industrial applications", "Robotics", "And so much more!"], "title": "What can you make with 6061 T6 Aluminum parts?"}, "featureChart": [{"label": "Strength", "rating": 5}, {"label": "Weldability", "rating": 4}, {"label": "Formability", "rating": 3}, {"label": "Heat Treating", "rating": 5}, {"label": "Corrosion Resistance", "rating": 3}, {"label": "Toughness", "rating": 3}, {"label": "Machinability", "rating": 4}, {"label": "Strength-to-Weight Ratio", "rating": 4}]}, "category_name": "Aluminum", "category_slug": "aluminum", "custom_fields": {}, "display_order": 0, "pricing_config": {".040\\"": {"0": "6", "price_per_width": "5", "price_per_length": "5"}, ".063\\"": {"0": "6", "price_per_width": "5", "price_per_length": "6"}, ".080\\"": {"0": "6", "price_per_width": "6", "price_per_length": "7"}, ".100\\"": {"0": "6", "price_per_width": "7", "price_per_length": "8"}, ".125\\"": {"0": "5", "price_per_width": "9", "price_per_length": "9"}, ".187\\"": {"0": "6", "price_per_width": "4", "price_per_length": "4"}, ".250\\"": {"0": "6", "price_per_width": "2", "price_per_length": "3"}, ".313\\"": {"0": "5", "price_per_width": "7", "price_per_length": "3"}, ".375\\"": {"0": "6", "price_per_width": "5", "price_per_length": "3"}, ".500\\"": {"0": "6", "price_per_width": "5", "price_per_length": "6"}, ".625\\"": {"0": "4", "price_per_width": "7", "price_per_length": "7"}, ".750\\"": {"0": "6", "price_per_width": "9", "price_per_length": "2"}, "1.000": {"price_per_width": "8", "price_per_length": "8"}, "1.250": {"price_per_width": "8", "price_per_length": "8"}, "1.500": {"price_per_width": "8", "price_per_length": "8"}, "1.750": {"price_per_width": "8", "price_per_length": "8"}, "2.000": {"price_per_width": "9", "price_per_length": "9"}}, "specificati